{
  "about": "Who may answer a Bench card and which answer stands. Read by the Rust bench tests (tests/scoped.rs) and the desktop TypeScript tests. Each alias is a fresh key; 'writer' is the Bench writer S, which supplies the seed taps. ownerSet is the owner plus members.txt. 'to' is the card's resolved answerers (scoped cards only). 'routed': true says the card's writer has a route target, so an unscoped card's free text is its reply too (default false). Kind 7 content is the 1-based keycap number or 'heart'; kind 9 content is a thread reply. 'target': 'other' aims the event at another card. Options in 'answer' are 1-based. No case relies on a tie in time.",
